Create a directory called "vf_scratch".
Create a directory called "vf_scratch/files".
a list called names is ["Alice", "Bob", "Charlie"].
print names's length.
If names's empty then,
    print "No names in list".
print "names is not empty, so the guard did not fire".
a text called 'the workspace' is "vf_scratch/files/fil-15-c1".
Create a directory called 'the workspace'.
a list called 'the pallet' is [].
If 'the pallet's length is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-15: expected 0 got {'the pallet's length}", Exit 95. Print 'the pallet's length.
a boolean called 'the pallet empty guard fired' is false.
If 'the pallet's empty then, Set 'the pallet empty guard fired' to true. Print 'the pallet empty guard fired'.
If 'the pallet empty guard fired' is false then, Print "ASSERT FIL-15: expected 1 got {'the pallet empty guard fired'}", Exit 95. Print 'the pallet empty guard fired'.
